# PathPilot AI - Environment Variables

## Backend (.env in backend/)

```bash
# Database
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///pathpilot.db

# For PostgreSQL (production):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/pathpilot

# JWT Authentication
JWT_SECRET=change-this-to-a-secure-random-string-in-production

# OpenAI API (optional - app works without it using deterministic recommendations)
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
```

## Frontend

No environment variables needed - the frontend proxies API calls to the backend via Next.js rewrites.

## Quick Start

### Backend
```bash
cd backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```

### Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

The app will be available at:
- Frontend: http://localhost:3000
- Backend API: http://localhost:8000
- API Docs: http://localhost:8000/docs
